  tenNhiemVu: "X\u01B0\u01A1ng Kh\xF4 Khung N\u1ECF"
  loaiQuest: 0
  idQuaiCanDiet: 8
  soLuongBoXuongCanDiet: 650
  idDoiTuongCanGiaiCuu: 0
  soLuongCanGiaiCuu: 1
  loiThoaiNhanQuest: "C\u1EA3nh b\xE1o nguy c\u1EA5p! Ngay tr\u01B0\u1EDBc s\xE0o
    huy\u1EC7t D\u1EA1 S\xE1t Ma Qu\xE2n, h\xE0ng ngh\xECn B\u1ED9c Bi\u1EC7t C\u1ED1t
    Binh (x\u01B0\u01A1ng c\u1EA3m t\u1EED) \u0111ang nh\xFAc nh\xEDch. Ch\xFAng
    mang theo h\u1ECFa n\u1ECF ma kh\xED t\u1EF1 s\xE1t, ch\u1EC9 c\u1EA7n \xE1p
    s\xE1t l\xE0 n\u1ED5 tung san b\u1EB1ng t\u1EA5t c\u1EA3! Mau di\u1EC7t s\u1EA1ch
    ch\xFAng t\u1EEB xa"
  loiThoaiDangLam: "Ti\u1EBFng n\u1ED5 ma h\u1ECFa vang l\xEAn li\xEAn ti\u1EBFp!
    \u0110\u1EA1o h\u1EEFu tuy\u1EC7t \u0111\u1ED1i kh\xF4ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
    \u0111\u1EC3 l\u0169 x\u01B0\u01A1ng c\u1EA3m t\u1EED \xE1p s\xE1t, h\xE3y ti\xEAu
    di\u1EC7t \u0111\u1EE7 s\u1ED1 l\u01B0\u1EE3ng tr\u01B0\u1EDBc khi ch\xFAng ph\xE1t
    n\u1ED5!"
  loiThoaiHoanThanh: "B\xE3o n\u1ED5 ma h\u1ECFa \u0111\xE3 d\u1EE9t! \u0110\u1EA1o
    h\u1EEFu \u0111\xE3 d\u1ECDn s\u1EA1ch ch\u01B0\u1EDBng ng\u1EA1i v\u1EADt cu\u1ED1i
    c\xF9ng. Ph\xEDa tr\u01B0\u1EDBc ch\xEDnh l\xE0 n\u01A1i phong \u1EA5n D\u1EA1
    S\xE1t Ma Qu\xE2n... H\xE3y nh\u1EADn l\u1EA5y ph\u1EA7n th\u01B0\u1EDFng cu\u1ED1i
    c\xF9ng v\xE0 chu\u1EA9n b\u1ECB cho tr\u1EADn quy\u1EBFt chi\u1EBFn"
